## Nginx: admin.elaai.co `/__api` proxy

Admin UI is static `dist/`; API calls go to `https://admin.elaai.co/__api/...`. Nginx must **strip** `/__api` before forwarding to Mercur on `:9000` (Medusa expects `/admin/...`, not `/__api/admin/...`).

```nginx
location /__api/ {
    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9000/;   # trailing slash on proxy_pass strips /__api/
    proxy_http_version 1.1;
    proxy_set_header Host api.elaai.co;
    proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
    proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
    proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
}
```

**Why the trailing slash matters:** `location /__api/` + `proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9000/` replaces the matched prefix. Request `/__api/admin/users` → upstream `/admin/users`. Without trailing slash (`proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9000`), nginx forwards the full URI `/__api/admin/users` → 404.

Requires aaPanel/Ruban (no sudo for `elaai`). After change: `nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx`.
