### elai-client (landing + shop, PM2)

Runs as **`pm2` `elai-client`** → nginx proxies `elaai.co` to `localhost:3000`.

**1. Build locally (WSL)** — env is baked in at build time:

```bash
cd /mnt/c/crucifer/BAW/ELAI/elai-client

cat > .env.production.local << 'EOF'
NEXT_PUBLIC_MERCUR_BACKEND_URL=https://api.elaai.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_MERCUR_VENDOR_URL=https://vendor.elaai.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_MERCUR_PUBLISHABLE_API_KEY=pk_YOUR_KEY
MERCUR_BACKEND_URL=https://api.elaai.co
MERCUR_PUBLISHABLE_API_KEY=pk_YOUR_KEY
EOF

npm ci
npm run build
```

Get `pk_...` from admin → Settings → Publishable API keys (or seed output).

**2. Upload** (do not build on VPS):

```bash
rsync -avz --delete --no-perms --no-owner --no-group --omit-dir-times \
  .next/ elaai@51.21.141.111:~/elai/elai-client/.next/

rsync -avz --no-perms --no-owner --no-group --omit-dir-times \
  public/ elaai@51.21.141.111:~/elai/elai-client/public/

scp .env.production.local package.json package-lock.json next.config.ts \
  elaai@51.21.141.111:~/elai/elai-client/
```

**3. On VPS** — restart only (no sudo):

```bash
ssh elaai@51.21.141.111
cd ~/elai/elai-client
# only if package.json deps changed: npm ci --omit=dev
pm2 restart elai-client
pm2 logs elai-client --lines 30
```

Verify: `https://elaai.co` and seller CTAs → `https://vendor.elaai.co/register`

### API

Only redeploy/restart when backend code changes: `pm2 restart mercur-api`. Onboarding UI changes do **not** need API redeploy.

## Stuck/slow VPS (no sudo)

- `pgrep -af 'bun|turbo|tsup|vite|tsc' | grep -v pm2` — if only `bun run start` / medusa cli, that is **mercur-api** (do not kill)
- Kill builds: `pkill -9 -f 'turbo run build'` etc.
- Slowness with high `%wa` + swap = RAM/disk pressure (php-fpm + low RAM), not necessarily an active build
- **Recovery without sudo:** `pm2 restart mercur-api` then `pm2 restart elai-client`; or `pm2 stop elai-client` briefly to free RAM
- If still very slow (curl health >> 1s): ask Ruban to **reboot VPS** or restart PHP-FPM
